WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Step 1: Open EC2 Settings -> Zones and click Open Global Views.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2: In AWS Global View -> Local Zones, opt in to eu-central-1-ist-1a (Istanbul).

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 3: Open VPC Console -> Create VPC and choose VPC and more.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Step 4: Select 1 Availability Zone, 0 private subnets, and pick eu-central-1-ist-1a.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 5: In Create subnet, choose Turkey (Istanbul) / eu-central-1-ist-1a.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Step 6: Verify the subnet is Available in eu-central-1-ist-1a (euc1-ist1-az1).

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Step 7: Open EC2 -> Launch an instance, name it, and select Debian.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Step 8: Choose a Local Zone-supported instance type (c7i.large) and key pair.

9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Step 9: Under Network settings, pick istanbul-lz-vpc, the Istanbul subnet, and Enable public IP.

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Step 10: Launch and verify Running state; connect via SSH using username admin.
